		<h1 class="page-title">OPAC</h1>
		<div class="entry clearfix">
			<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-full"><img decoding="async" width="391" height="129" src="https://centrallibrary.cutn.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/opac.png" alt="" class="wp-image-1713" srcset="https://centrallibrary.cutn.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/opac.png 391w, https://centrallibrary.cutn.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/opac-300x99.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 391px) 100vw, 391px" /></figure>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Online Public Access Catalog (OPAC), Central Library offers computerized Catalogue Search Service though the Web OPAC. Users can have a look at the details of library holdings &#8211; books, CD/DVD, conference proceedings, reports, thesis and dissertations and can search through this interface. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Users can search on following elements of the bibliographic record of a document by author search, title search, subject search. In addition to listing what the Library has in its collection, the online catalog provides the location of each item, its call number, and its availability. </p>



